ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Abstract Expressionism
Board: /styles/abstract-expressionism
Companions: abstract-expressionism-starter.html, abstract-expressionism-study.ai, abstract-expressionism-study.psd

Artboards
1. Gesture field, 3600 × 2400 px. Marks run off all four edges. No subject.
2. A small label outside the field, plain sans: "gesture, not color field."

Palette
Ground #c2b6a2. Black #1c1a17. Blue #243c66. Red #8d1f2a. Bone #d8d2c6.

Rules
- All-over. Density must vary. An even pattern fails.
- No figure and no hidden face.
- Do not make a stack of soft rectangles on this board. That is the other method.
- Do not reproduce any existing painting.
